<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="600" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">Hello,&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">[Insert Name]</span><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">&nbsp;</span></span></font></div><div style=""><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);"><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></span></span></div><div style=""><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">The American Red Cross is proud to offer learning-in-action opportunities for your high school students that will develop and recognize their leadership and humanitarian spirit. Our programs help fulfill the needs of educational institutions to be part of the community fabric by raising future leaders and giving back. We are pleased to&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">offer your school with&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 14.6667px;">a unique program that will help save lives and support your students achieve higher education.</span></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="font-family: arial;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Georgia&quot;,serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span><span style="font-family: Georgia, serif; font-size: 11pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">The
High School Scholarship Program is available to high schools that host at least
one Red Cross blood drive during the year. In return, the Red Cross will
provide a scholarship to your school based on the total number of blood units
collected. The more pints of blood your school collects, the more scholarship
money your school is eligible to receive. Representatives from your school will
select the scholarship recipient(s) based on Red Cross recommended criteria. <o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">High
schools that partner with the Red Cross through this scholarship program
receive the satisfaction of knowing that they have helped deliver lifesaving
services and blood products to patients in need and can recognize the student
leaders who help save lives. Your partnership will help build a stronger
community for many years to come.<o:p></o:p></font></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><o:p><font face="Arial, sans-serif">&nbsp;</font></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style=""><span style="font-size: 11pt;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">I would like to share and discuss the opportunity
for your school to participate in this scholarship program. I would need 15
minutes of your time and am happy to meet at a time that is convenient for you,
including before or after school. If you have any questions, please feel free
to contact me.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font><font face="Georgia, serif"><o:p></o:p></font></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[Kind regards,<div><span class="ui-provider fy b c d e f g h i j k l m n o p q r s t u v w x y z ab ac ae af ag ah ai aj ak" dir="ltr" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);">[Insert Name]</span></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>